# Build artifacts
# v21.1.0 CHANGE: dist/ ab git me TRACK NAHI hota (Phase-1.2).
# Fresh build guarantee ab 3 layers se aata hai:
#   1) supervisor.js ensureFrontend — dist missing/stale pe auto npm ci+build
#   2) Render build command: npm ci && npm run build (README me documented)
#   3) CI (.github/workflows/ci.yml) har push pe build verify karta hai
# Fayda: har commit me 40+ hashed-bundle files ka noise nahi, repo chhota,
# stale bundle kabhi serve nahi hoga (stamp-mismatch boot warning + 503 self-heal page).
